      end

      # Update an API key.
      #
      # Rename a key or change its permission and restrictions. The token and the mode never change; the new
      # rights apply to the next request. Requires a full-access live key; test keys get 403
      # test_key_restricted.
      #
      # @param id [String] API key id.
      # @param params [Hash] the parameters below, also accepted as keyword arguments
      # @option params [String] :name 1–100 characters.
      # @option params [String] :permission One of: full_access, sending_access.
      # @option params [String, nil] :domain_id Restrict sending to one verified domain (sending access only).
